<template><article class="surface surface-pad guidelines"><span class="eyebrow">Community guidelines</span><h1 class="serif-title">Curious, kind, and grounded</h1><p>BARNALI is a place to ask honest questions, share first-hand experience, and learn from people with different perspectives.</p><h2>Start with respect</h2><p>Address ideas without attacking people. No harassment, hate, threats, or sharing private information.</p><h2>Be clear about what you know</h2><p>Separate personal experience from claims of fact. Add useful sources when a claim depends on outside information, and correct mistakes when you find them.</p><h2>Keep rooms useful</h2><p>Stay close to the room's topic. Do not spam, impersonate others, or use discussions for unwanted promotion.</p><h2>Report a concern</h2><p>Use the Report action on a public discussion. Reports are reviewed by authorized moderators and do not guarantee a particular outcome.</p></article></template>
